{
  "Pregnancy.Minerva.BellyDistended": "<b>Your belly is distended with pregnancy. You wish you could spend all day bathing.</b>[pg]"
  "Pregnancy.Minerva.BellyFull": "<b>Your belly is as big as it can get. Your unborn children shuffle relentlessly, calming only when you try singing lullabies.</b>[pg]"
  "Pregnancy.Minerva.BellySlightlyLarger": "<b>You realize your belly has gotten slightly larger. You could go for some peaches around now.</b>[pg]"
  "Pregnancy.Minerva.BellyTwins": "<b>Your belly has grown enough for it to be twins. Well, you <em>did</em> want to restore sirens to the world.</b>[pg]"
  "Pregnancy.Minerva.HipsWider": "[pg]After the birth your {0} fits a bit more snugly about your {1}."
  "Pregnancy.Minerva.SwollenWithMilk": "Your breasts feel swollen with all the extra milk they're accumulating. You wonder just what kind of creature they're getting ready to feed.[pg]"
}
